[E0414] Error: cannot borrow `v` as `&var` while a `for` loop walks it
    ╭─[ err/121_vec_while_lent/main.wip:11:9 ]
    │
 10 │     for x in v.items() {
    │              ────┬────  
    │                  ╰────── walked here; the loop's binding refers to its elements
 11 │         v.push(x)                   // it could move the elements
    │         ┬  
    │         ╰── borrowed here
    │ 
    │ Note: a `for` binding refers to the element itself, so what the loop walks must not change until the loop ends
────╯
